This PR introduces a proxy server that exposes ComputerAgent functionality over both HTTP REST API  connections, enabling remote clients to interact with agents through OpenAI-compatible endpoints.

This API matches the [Responses API](https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/responses) from OpenAI

## HTTP Proxy Usage
Start cua-computer-server
```bash
pip install cua-agent[all] cua-computer-server # Both of these need to be installed to use the Agent Proxy
python -m computer_server.main
```
Request Format
```json
{
  "model": "anthropic/claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022",
  "input": "Your instruction here",
  "agent_kwargs": {
    "save_trajectory": true,
    "verbosity": 20
  },
  "computer_kwargs": {
    "os_type": "linux",
    "provider_type": "cloud"
  }
}
```
Send multimodal request
```bash
curl http://localhost:8000/responses \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "model": "anthropic/claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022",
    "input": [
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": [
          {"type": "input_text", "text": "what is in this image?"},
          {
            "type": "input_image",
            "image_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Gfp-wisconsin-madison-the-nature-boardwalk.jpg/2560px-Gfp-wisconsin-madison-the-nature-boardwalk.jpg"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }'
```

