### Workaround and additional context

Workaround: Pass the `bundle_id` (e.g. `{"app": "com.apple.calculator"}`), `pid`, or the localized Chinese name (`{"app": "计算器"}`) to `list_windows`.

Additional context: PR #5390 (`fix(cua-driver): locate Finder by name on macOS`) special-cased Finder, but other localized system and third-party apps on non-English macOS still fail when queried by their English bundle/executable name.

